# Product Design Constraints

Source of truth: `BUILD_SPEC.md` §3 and §7.

## Visual timer

- The shrinking pie/bar/ring is the product — large, full-screen when active, bespoke (reanimated + SVG), not a generic progress bar with a label.
- No digital countdown by default; optional MM:SS toggle only.
- Color shift as time runs low (e.g. green → yellow → red).

## Zero friction (ADHD)

- Task name and category are optional. "Just start a timer" must stay one tap from home.
- Prefer big number pickers over tiny text fields for duration.
- Guest / offline mode on first open — prompt to sign up later as "back up your data," not a gate.

## Insights tone

- Deterministic stats only (rolling `(actual - predicted) / predicted` per category) — no AI.
- Frame as self-knowledge ("you tend to...") never criticism ("you're bad at...").

## Timer accuracy

- Always `elapsed = now - startTimestamp` (plus pause accounting). Never rely on a JS interval alone for correctness.
